[stderr] +This is the sole successor dispatcher for the unresolved QB-A editorial
[stderr] +records recorded by `GD0002`. It preserves the existing 48-card boundary and
[stderr] +does not create cards, publish cards, alter quiz scope, create B/R runbooks, or
[stderr] +accept `../planning/game-design-manifest.json`.
[stderr] +
[stderr] +The current register deliberately records all 48 revision-1 cards as `draft`
[stderr] +and `selectionEligible: false`. Every card retains the exact reasons
[stderr] +`ORIGINALITY-UNAUTHORED`, `PROVENANCE-LOCATOR-MISSING`,
[stderr] +`FACTUAL-RIGHTS-REVIEW-PENDING`, `ACCESSIBILITY-COPY-REVIEW-PENDING`, and
[stderr] +`RELEASE-GATE-INCOMPLETE`. No default, batch-level decision, or future wave
[stderr] +may substitute for a card's current-revision evidence.
[stderr] +
[stderr] +## Bounded editorial waves
[stderr] +
[stderr] +Each wave below is limited to one existing 12-card batch. Within a wave, author
[stderr] +evidence first and review it only after the current-revision authoring evidence
[stderr] +is complete. A card that is rejected, unresolved, conflicted, withdrawn, or
[stderr] +missing any required record stays ineligible with its exact reason retained.
[stderr] +
[stderr] +| Wave | Existing batch | Fixed card IDs | Required card-level work | Completion boundary |
[stderr] +| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |
[stderr] +| E1 | `GPI-002` — World Tournament History | `QB-A-01`–`QB-A-12` | Original expression; exact permitted-source locators and checked dates for every assertion; conflict/correction state; factual/rights review; accessibility/copy review; independent second review. | 12 current-revision records only. |
[stderr] +| E2 | `GPI-003` — Domestic League Moments | `QB-A-13`–`QB-A-24` | Same evidence and distinct-review requirements as E1. | 12 current-revision records only. |
