[stderr] +accepted by distinct reviewers for the exact revision. The release editor may
[stderr] +set `published` only after those accepted decisions, accepted originality and
[stderr] +provenance evidence, no unresolved conflict, and the defined lifecycle
[stderr] +transitions. Until then a selector must reject it because the register's
[stderr] +selection rule remains binding.
[stderr] +
